@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JoeyIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JoeyIntro::
	.string "My POKéMON rule!\n"
	.string "Check them out!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JoeyDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JoeyDefeat::
	.string "Ouch! A scrape!\n"
	.string "I have to put on a bandage!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JoeyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JoeyPostBattle::
	.string "Bandages are signs of toughness!\n"
	.string "I've got another one!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JoseIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JoseIntro::
	.string "My BUG POKéMON are tough!\n"
	.string "Let's battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JoseDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JoseDefeat::
	.string "I lost!\n"
	.string "I thought I had you!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JosePostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JosePostBattle::
	.string "BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\n"
	.string "So they get strong quickly, too.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_ClarkIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_ClarkIntro::
	.string "If the tunnel doesn't go through, then\n"
	.string "I'll just go over the top.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_ClarkDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_ClarkDefeat::
	.string "Gasp… Gasp…\n"
	.string "Losing made me tired…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_ClarkPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_ClarkPostBattle::
	.string "It's no big deal if there's no tunnel.\n"
	.string "To a HIKER, mountains are roads!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JaniceIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JaniceIntro::
	.string "Let me teach you how strong my\n"
	.string "adorable POKéMON is!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JaniceDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JaniceDefeat::
	.string "You're a notch above me…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JanicePostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JanicePostBattle::
	.string "POKéMON that possess cuteness and\n"
	.string "power, that's ideal, I think.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_KarenIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_KarenIntro::
	.string "I study at school, and I study on\n"
	.string "the way home, too!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_KarenDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_KarenDefeat::
	.string "I'm in shock--I lost?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_KarenPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_KarenPostBattle::
	.string "Awww, I'll never become an elegant\n"
	.string "TRAINER like ROXANNE this way!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JerryIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JerryIntro::
	.string "We learn all sorts of things at the\n"
	.string "TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\p"
	.string "I want to test things out for real!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JerryDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JerryDefeat::
	.string "I slacked off in school…\n"
	.string "That's why I lost.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JerryPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JerryPostBattle::
	.string "I'll have to redo some courses at\n"
	.string "the TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\l"
	.string "If I don't, ROXANNE will be steamed.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_SarahIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_SarahIntro::
	.string "Just so you know, I've never once been\n"
	.string "bested by anyone at anything.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_SarahDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_SarahDefeat::
	.string "Oh, my goodness.\n"
	.string "This is a new experience for me.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_SarahPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_SarahPostBattle::
	.string "My life of luxury affords me all that\n"
	.string "I could possibly desire.\p"
	.string "However, when it comes to POKéMON,\n"
	.string "my wealth has no meaning.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_DawsonIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_DawsonIntro::
	.string "When you lay your eyes on my POKéMON's\n"
	.string "gorgeous fur, their beauty will render\l"
	.string "you helpless!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_DawsonDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_DawsonDefeat::
	.string "Oh, baby, say it isn't so!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_DawsonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_DawsonPostBattle::
	.string "Oh, no, no, no!\n"
	.string "You've mussed up my POKéMON's fur!\l"
	.string "You've ruined my hairdo, too!\l"
	.string "I'll have to call my stylist now!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JohnsonIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JohnsonIntro::
	.string "It's a dead end up here.\n"
	.string "I'm bored, so can we battle?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JohnsonDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JohnsonDefeat::
	.string "That was fun even though I lost.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_JohnsonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_JohnsonPostBattle::
	.string "Want to stay here and keep\n"
	.string "me company?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_DevanIntro
Hoenn_Route116_Text_DevanIntro::
	.string "We'll rock you hard!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_DevanDefeat
Hoenn_Route116_Text_DevanDefeat::
	.string "Aiyiyi!\n"
	.string "No contest at all!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route116_Text_DevanPostBattle
Hoenn_Route116_Text_DevanPostBattle::
	.string "I should try different POKéMON\n"
	.string "types, that's what I ought to do.$"

