@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc: Route116_Text_TrainerTipsBToStopEvolution
Hoenn_Route116_Text_TrainerTipsBToStopEvolution::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "If you want to stop a POKéMON from\n"
	.string "evolving, press the B Button while it\l"
	.string "is trying to evolve.\l"
	.string "The startled POKéMON will stop.\p"
	.string "This is called an evolution cancel.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc: Route116_Text_TrainerTipsBagHasPockets
